      <title>Stripe 75亿美元收购OpenRouter，AI支付融合加速</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260820/Stripe-75%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%ADOpenRouterAI%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F/</link>
